-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-04-25T19:48:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T23:33:55Z","closed_at":"2025-04-25T23:30:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105767.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-25T23:30:25Z"},"body":"The int `Memory::alloc_count` is being incremented and decremented in `Memory`, but never used.\r\nAs an atomic, it is quite slow. It should be removed.\r\n\r\nThis bottleneck was found by @Nazarwadim in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97016#issuecomment-2356447368.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI benchmarked a ~15% improvement for `Memory::alloc_static`:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 20000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\tMemory::alloc_static(16);\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed:\r\n- `306ms` on master\r\n- `263ms` on this PR","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105767/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105767/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}